- Added external JWT authentication for API-only users. When `auth.jwt_issuers` is configured, a short-lived JWT from a configured OpenID Connect issuer, whose subject a global admin has bound to an API-only user with `PUT /api/v1/fleet/users/api_only/:id/external_identities`, authenticates as that user. Automations such as `fleetctl gitops` in GitHub Actions no longer need a stored Fleet API token.
